OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FThe
OL,6,Fweather looks dry and settled through
OL,7,Fthe period. There will be plenty of
OL,8,Fsunshine, and temperatures will creep
OL,9,Fback up, so feeling hot again, with
OL,10,Fwinds remaining light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
